---
---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-20 sm:space-y-28">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Proprio come un <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          registratore di cassa. <br />
          <span class="text-[#FF6B00]">Anzi, meglio!</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <strong class="text-zinc-900 font-bold">Semplice e completa.</strong> Accetta pagamenti con qualsiasi metodo, <strong class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold">anche con SumUp e Nexi</strong>, e gestisci incassi ed emissione dello scontrino in un unico flusso.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Puoi accettare più metodi di pagamento nello stesso scontrino (es. parte contanti e parte carta) e lavorare in modo più veloce, direttamente da smartphone o tablet.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-3">
          <a
            href="#prezzi"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white bg-[#FF6B00] hover:bg-[#E55F00] active:scale-95 rounded-2xl transition-colors"
          >
            Inizia Ora
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg aspect-[4/3] rounded-[2.5rem] bg-zinc-100 p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center justify-center border border-zinc-200">
          
          <div class="absolute left-6 top-8 w-60 sm:w-68 bg-white rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-zinc-200 text-[10px] transform -translate-x-3 -rotate-2 opacity-85 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-zinc-100 text-zinc-400 font-bold">
              <span>Cassa</span>
              <span class="text-[#FF6B00]">★ Categorie</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-2">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-orange-50 text-[#FF6B00] font-bold">Servizi Sala</div>
              <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 font-semibold">Vendita Prodotti</div>
              <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 font-semibold">Consulenze</div>
              <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 font-semibold">Accessori</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="relative z-10 w-64 sm:w-72 bg-white rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 ml-auto mr-2 shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-zinc-100 font-bold text-zinc-400 text-[11px]">
              <span>Cassa #01</span>
              <span class="text-rose-500">Annulla Pagamento</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 py-3 border-b border-zinc-100 text-[11px]">
              <div class="flex justify-between font-semibold">
                <span>Totale (1 pz)</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900">56,00€</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-zinc-500">
                <span>Pagamento in Contanti</span>
                <span>36,00€</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-[#FF6B00]">
                <span>Da pagare residuo</span>
                <span>20,00€</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center my-3">
              <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase font-semibold">Importo selezionato</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-900">20,00€</div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
              <button class="py-2.5 bg-[#FF6B00] text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-center">
                Contanti
              </button>
              <button class="py-2.5 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-800 font-bold rounded-xl text-center border border-zinc-200">
                Elettronico
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg aspect-[4/3] rounded-[2.5rem] bg-zinc-100 p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center justify-center border border-zinc-200">
          
          <div class="relative w-64 sm:w-72">
            <div class="absolute -top-12 left-10 w-36 bg-white rounded-t-lg p-2.5 border-t border-x border-zinc-300 text-center font-mono text-[8px] text-zinc-700 z-0 shadow-sm">
              <p class="font-bold border-b border-dashed border-zinc-300 pb-1">DOCUMENTO COMMERCIALE</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-black text-[9px] text-zinc-900">TOTALE € 24,00</p>
              <div class="w-8 h-8 mx-auto my-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded p-0.5 flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 border-2 border-white"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[6px] text-zinc-400">AdE Online</p>
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 bg-zinc-950 rounded-[2.2rem] p-4 text-white border-2 border-zinc-800 shadow-lg">
              <div class="h-20 bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 p-2 flex items-center justify-center relative">
                <div class="w-24 h-2 bg-zinc-700 rounded-full mb-1"></div>
                <div class="absolute bottom-1 w-full text-center text-[8px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#FF6B00] uppercase">
                  Bluetooth Thermal
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between border border-zinc-800">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-300 font-bold">READY</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B00] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">
                  ⏻
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-2 text-center text-[9px] text-zinc-400 font-semibold">
                Compatibile con rulli standard 58mm
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Lo <span class="text-[#FF6B00]">scontrino è digitale</span>, ma, <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          se serve, puoi stamparlo. <br />
          <span class="text-zinc-900">Anche in mobilità!</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Grazie alla copia digitale conforme dell'Agenzia delle Entrate, potrai inviare il documento commerciale al cliente via <strong class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold">WhatsApp, SMS o Email</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Se serve, collegando una piccola stampante termica tascabile Bluetooth, potrai stampare i tuoi scontrini cartacei <strong class="text-[#FF6B00] font-semibold">ovunque ti trovi</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-3">
          <a
            href="#prezzi"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white bg-[#FF6B00] hover:bg-[#E55F00] active:scale-95 rounded-2xl transition-colors"
          >
            Scopri di più
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>